    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But it doesn't feel like something that will just \"pass,\" Elara. It feels permanent. Like the light just went out and there's no way to relight it. I'm just tired of struggling against a tide that's already won. Every step feels like I'm dragging a corpse behind me. Is there even a point to continuing when the world is just... quiet and empty?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
